Subject: [PATCH 18/22] POC-11b: code picker for Ultra/Master Ball chips, Poke
 Mart chip shelves

- Ultra Ball (tiers 3-4) and Master Ball (every move) rewards ask for the code
  (LEFT/RIGHT, A) on the post-battle screen
- Poke Mart menu gets CHIPS: a per-town chip shelf (8 chips, curated by
  progression; every other row in the move's second code), price 60 x MB

